the stores compare to e-commerce sites because fitting , additional elements etc all this comes as separate thing and costs more, if u r going to store they will not cost u for such things.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909036,"PostDate":1452061776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is more better to check the stores compare to e-commerce sites because fitting , additional elements etc all this comes as separate thing and costs more, if u r going to store they will not cost u for such things.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"priyamsharma73@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450162104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Priyam","Id":285595,"Name":"Priyam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.153.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93cbf951d85de320c9e6eb038abab694","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi, i already check some website like bhs, weddingfaz, wallao, brides and jjdress. They are so cool and amazing,,, you check them out.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909095,"PostDate":1452152986,"PostContent":