Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":378,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1908820,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1451679994,"LastPoster":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1908820,"PostDate":1451679994,"PostContent":"Hi All! \u00a0 We're down to tiny details now! My FI and I have been trying to figure out a way for gu...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422356723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.95.36.145","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bd5aaeb045a4b020ed50120d629c170","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re down to tiny details now! My FI and I have been trying to figure out a way for guests to communicate at the resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My FMIL does not have a smart phone and my dad is not on Facebook. Our original idea was to create a facebook group so we could use the WIFI and people could message through that, but not everyone would be included.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll plan on being at the same restaurant every morning for breakfast around 9 so that everyone can meet up there and discuss plans, but wanted to see if anyone had any ideas?!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908820,"PostDate":1451679994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're down to tiny details now! My FI and I have been trying to figure out a way for guests to communicate at the resort.<\/p>\n<p>My FMIL does not have a smart phone and my dad is not on Facebook. Our original idea was to create a facebook group so we could use the WIFI and people could message through that, but not everyone would be included.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll plan on being at the same restaurant every morning for breakfast around 9 so that everyone can meet up there and discuss plans, but wanted to see if anyone had any ideas?!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422356723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4562b897bd4e47817cdfcd0db2b7d936","RawContent":"I&#039;ve heard of some using walkie talkies and others just phones like you&#039;ve mentioned.  That said we did none of this and it just sorts itself out!!!! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908822,"PostDate":1451682160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've heard of some using walkie talkies and others just phones like you've mentioned.  That said we did none of this and it just sorts itself out!!!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04b266e00466a9de0621f8384d09afea","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hardyali\" post=\"1908820\" timestamp=\"1451697994\"]\nHi All!\n\nWe&#039;re down to tiny details now! My FI and I have been trying to figure out a way for guests to communicate at the resort.\nMy FMIL does not have a smart phone and my dad is not on Facebook. Our original idea was to create a facebook group so we could use the WIFI and people could message through that, but not everyone would be included.\n\nWe&#039;ll plan on being at the same restaurant every morning for breakfast around 9 so that everyone can meet up there and discuss plans, but wanted to see if anyone had any ideas?!\n\nthanks![\/quote]@[member=\"hardyali\"] usually these things sort themselves out.  Other options is to create a watsup group everyone can always connect to the wifi.\n\nHappy Planning and Happy New year!\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1908929,"PostDate":1451904827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hardyali, on 01 January 2016 - 08:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're down to tiny details now! My FI and I have been trying to figure out a way for guests to communicate at the resort.<\/p>\n<p>My FMIL does not have a smart phone and my dad is not on Facebook. Our original idea was to create a facebook group so we could use the WIFI and people could message through that, but not everyone would be included.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll plan on being at the same restaurant every morning for breakfast around 9 so that everyone can meet up there and discuss plans, but wanted to see if anyone had any ideas?!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281894\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281894-hardyali\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">hardyali<\/span><\/a> usually these things sort themselves out. \u00a0Other options is to create a watsup group everyone can always connect to the wifi.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning and Happy New year!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.95.36.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3e4c63ef51f673305cd81ea073a657c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dreamweddings\" post=\"1908929\" timestamp=\"1451922827\"]\n@[member=\"hardyali\"] usually these things sort themselves out.  Other options is to create a watsup group everyone can always connect to the wifi.\n \nHappy Planning and Happy New year!\nJoyce[\/quote]\nThanks Joyce!!! We ended up sending a\nPre departure letter and recommended downloading whatsapp! \n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] we also decided to to have breakfast at the buffet each morning at the same time in case people want to meet up!  Less than a month until we leave so I am full panic mode","Attachments":[],"Id":1909521,"PostDate":1452802646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreamweddings, on 04 January 2016 - 10:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281894\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281894-hardyali\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">hardyali<\/span><\/a> usually these things sort themselves out. \u00a0Other options is to create a watsup group everyone can always connect to the wifi.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHappy Planning and Happy New year!<br>\nJoyce<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nThanks Joyce!!! We ended up sending a<br>\nPre departure letter and recommended downloading whatsapp! <br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> we also decided to to have breakfast at the buffet each morning at the same time in case people want to meet up!  Less than a month until we leave so I am full panic mode \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422356723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8c50e15b91be4ebeeaa488b560cccaf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"hardyali\"] is absolutely normal to be on panic mode. &amp;nbsp;FYI you are going to have an amazing time. make sure you take the time to look around you and be in the moment. &amp;nbsp;how many times in our lives do we get all the people we love to be in one place at the same time?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Last month of Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909523,"PostDate":1452804433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281894\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281894-hardyali\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">hardyali<\/span><\/a> is absolutely normal to be on panic mode. \u00a0FYI you are going to have an amazing time. make sure you take the time to look around you and be in the moment. \u00a0how many times in our lives do we get all the people we love to be in one place at the same time?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Last month of Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79824","Title":"Keeping In Touch With Guests At The Resort?","LastPostDate":1452804433},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
