{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":23,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":3714,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1879580,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281306,"Name":"Petra","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281306.jpg?_r=1417719179","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1417627057,"LastPoster":{"Id":282157,"Name":"tan38","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282157.png?_r=1425494284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":124,"Preview":{"Id":1887513,"PostDate":1424873709,"PostContent":"I had been harassing numerous TA's and Tour Operators for a long time .. I am sure they all have\u00a0...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tanvan1976@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.231.128.246","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424271586,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282157.png?_r=1425494284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tan38","Id":282157,"Name":"tan38","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.141.11.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65708a0afe724e346fa13b0809514318","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I went to three different TAs and directly to the airline as well. Air Canada quoted me $1550 per person, roughly. &amp;nbsp;A local travel agency quoted me $1420 pp with westjet and $1550 for Air Canada. LaurieLee was able to get me $1519 pp with Air Canada, and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$1321.53 pp with westjet&lt;\/strong&gt; and convince the resort to honour their initial email saying that I could get married at the beach site of another of the complex&#039;s resorts. It has definitely been worth it for me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880154,"PostDate":1418310332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I went to three different TAs and directly to the airline as well. Air Canada quoted me $1550 per person, roughly. \u00a0A local travel agency quoted me $1420 pp with westjet and $1550 for Air Canada. LaurieLee was able to get me $1519 pp with Air Canada, and <strong>\u00a0$1321.53 pp with westjet<\/strong> and convince the resort to honour their initial email saying that I could get married at the beach site of another of the complex's resorts. It has definitely been worth it for me.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magscharron@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.11.150","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1393249130,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Maggietron","Id":276860,"Name":"Maggietron","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.122.185.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9552b372832b51594f2bdb9976ee8d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;A good TA is SO important. I&#039;ve talked to about 5 since starting to look for a resort. A lot can&#039;t give you specific answers about resorts and others try to push you into a resort you don&#039;t like because they are familiar with it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I recently found one who specializes in the country I was looking at and knew specifics about the resort I was most interested in. AND he was able to get me a better rate of $1102 vs $1200 all in, 7 days.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885295,"PostDate":1423124589,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>A good TA is SO important. I've talked to about 5 since starting to look for a resort. A lot can't give you specific answers about resorts and others try to push you into a resort you don't like because they are familiar with it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I recently found one who specializes in the country I was looking at and knew specifics about the resort I was most interested in. AND he was able to get me a better rate of $1102 vs $1200 all in, 7 days.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"empty_xo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416679537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281229.jpg?_r=1451861956","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Brandii","Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.92.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f43e485113235aa0c41965d119f4b5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had been harassing numerous TA&#039;s and Tour Operators for a long time .. I am sure they all have&amp;nbsp;me blocked by now .. LOL ..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My BIL recommended a TA that he knows personally and she was able to get us a group rate of $1575.00 per adult, dbl occupancy through SUNWING @ RIU Ocho Rios - Jan.7-14, 2016, every 11th Adult free (minus taxes, etc.),&amp;nbsp;up to max. of 4, departing Toronto&amp;nbsp;.. IF you go on Sunwing.ca right now exact same is over $1900 per adult ..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So we are feeling pretty lucky right now .. It wasn&#039;t exactly what we wanted but it was the best deal .. The other resort we wanted is going for $2100 per adult .. *GASP* .. I was not about to make our guests pay that much .. Ridiculous .. So we compromised on our expectations ..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887513,"PostDate":1424873709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had been harassing numerous TA's and Tour Operators for a long time .. I am sure they all have\u00a0me blocked by now .. LOL ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My BIL recommended a TA that he knows personally and she was able to get us a group rate of $1575.00 per adult, dbl occupancy through SUNWING @ RIU Ocho Rios - Jan.7-14, 2016, every 11th Adult free (minus taxes, etc.),\u00a0up to max. of 4, departing Toronto\u00a0.. IF you go on Sunwing.ca right now exact same is over $1900 per adult ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So we are feeling pretty lucky right now .. It wasn't exactly what we wanted but it was the best deal .. The other resort we wanted is going for $2100 per adult .. *GASP* .. I was not about to make our guests pay that much .. Ridiculous .. So we compromised on our expectations ..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tanvan1976@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.231.128.246","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424271586,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282157.png?_r=1425494284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tan38","Id":282157,"Name":"tan38","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78442","Title":"Costs Pp Of Destination Wedding","LastPostDate":1424873709},"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
