{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e815178a4964f2f7ff8567d70155c6c4","RawContent":"Thank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n&#039;th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We&#039;re looking at a group of 30 (plus us)\n[quote name=\"Dimps\" post=\"1879589\" timestamp=\"1417649647\"]\nHi Petra, if you are really organized and determined you can build your own package. Contact the hotel directly and coordinate your flights.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Dimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I&#039;m afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto!","Attachments":[],"Id":1879642,"PostDate":1417688269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n'th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We're looking at a group of 30 (plus us)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dimps, on 03 December 2014 - 06:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Petra, if you are really organized and determined you can build your own package. Contact the hotel directly and coordinate your flights.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Dimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I'm afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"petrahollosi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417626942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281306.jpg?_r=1417719179","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Petra","Id":281306,"Name":"Petra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df3f68982b6b779e6dd8af1289667944","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Petra\" post=\"1879642\" timestamp=\"1417706269\"]\nThank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n&#039;th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We&#039;re looking at a group of 30 (plus us)\n\nDimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I&#039;m afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto![\/quote]You need to work with a TA not just direct to that tour operator, it&#039;s your best bet on getting added perks at your resort and the best pricing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879644,"PostDate":1417688378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Petra, on 04 December 2014 - 10:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n'th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We're looking at a group of 30 (plus us)<br><br>\nDimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I'm afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYou need to work with a TA not just direct to that tour operator, it's your best bet on getting added perks at your resort and the best pricing. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390238608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54051b35ce2e029110a92eafcd4f1e3a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1879644\" timestamp=\"1417706378\"]\nYou need to work with a TA not just direct to that tour operator, it&#039;s your best bet on getting added perks at your resort and the best pricing.[\/quote]Hi there, do you have any suggestions or do you suggest using our local travel agent?","Attachments":[],"Id":1879645,"PostDate":1417688459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 04 December 2014 - 10:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You need to work with a TA not just direct to that tour operator, it's your best bet on getting added perks at your resort and the best pricing.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi there, do you have any suggestions or do you suggest using our local travel agent?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"petrahollosi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417626942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281306.jpg?_r=1417719179","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Petra","Id":281306,"Name":"Petra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2debb6a3e2dd75a1c8fb3398c9b5a12c","RawContent":"A few of us in canada are using Laurielee she is awesome... And has great relationships out there. If you were in the US I would recommend owners of this site- wright travel hands down best in the states.... Laurielee.ca is her website if you want to check out who a few of us are using.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879646,"PostDate":1417689586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A few of us in canada are using Laurielee she is awesome... And has great relationships out there. If you were in the US I would recommend owners of this site- wright travel hands down best in the states.... Laurielee.ca is her website if you want to check out who a few of us are using. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390238608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e1a852c63aa2eb0c22c10f55063ed8e","RawContent":"$100 off is a $100, better than nothing IMO. At the start we were about $100 less but as time went on and until our flight and resort sold out it was close to $500 less we paid. \n\n\nI also agree go to a TA not just the airline. They can work better deals, etc.  Local or not isn&#039;t an issue but one who has some experience with destination weddings is a good idea.  I&#039;m in AB and mine is in BC. She was great. \n\n\nBeing Canadian I don&#039;t recommend doing flight and resort separate.  We have one guest doing this as they are moving and weren&#039;t sure when and it&#039;s costing them soooooo much more. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879648,"PostDate":1417689841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                $100 off is a $100, better than nothing IMO. At the start we were about $100 less but as time went on and until our flight and resort sold out it was close to $500 less we paid. <br><br>\nI also agree go to a TA not just the airline. They can work better deals, etc.  Local or not isn't an issue but one who has some experience with destination weddings is a good idea.  I'm in AB and mine is in BC. She was great. <br><br>\nBeing Canadian I don't recommend doing flight and resort separate.  We have one guest doing this as they are moving and weren't sure when and it's costing them soooooo much more. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23d050c5110386f4013d6766c3a6a481","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] who are you using in BC? I will check out Laurilee too&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879668,"PostDate":1417700984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> who are you using in BC? I will check out Laurilee too<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"petrahollosi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.124.229.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417626942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281306.jpg?_r=1417719179","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Petra","Id":281306,"Name":"Petra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"139fbf27f535fe79c11a0f00446c206d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Petra\" post=\"1879668\" timestamp=\"1417718984\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] who are you using in BC? I will check out Laurilee too[\/quote]Don&#039;t have her number in front of me but I&#039;ll private PM you after lunch!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879676,"PostDate":1417701980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Petra, on 04 December 2014 - 01:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> who are you using in BC? I will check out Laurilee too<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDon't have her number in front of me but I'll private PM you after lunch!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.74.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1b32af1e41a11333b4c9d7c76597537","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Petra\" post=\"1879642\" timestamp=\"1417706269\"]\nThank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n&#039;th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We&#039;re looking at a group of 30 (plus us)\n\nDimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I&#039;m afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto![\/quote]Definitely work with a TA. Where are you going? \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879688,"PostDate":1417707356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Petra, on 04 December 2014 - 10:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thank you ladies! I have been getting quotes from Sunwing and other companies like it....I really am not finding any difference in the prices except that, like you said, the n'th passenger goes free. That is maybe $100 off per person. We're looking at a group of 30 (plus us)<br><br>\nDimps - did you do this? How did it work out for you? I just contacted the hotel to see what the prices would be.. but I'm afraid the flight costs would be too much coming from Toronto!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDefinitely work with a TA. Where are you going? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>This dress is for sale by the way","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394139595,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277037.jpg?_r=1435766133","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1418134675,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aff896c05bf88311baf1295e171d28b5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879592\" timestamp=\"1417650309\"]\nWere you able to do this and get perks?\n\nI got 2 free trips and an upgrade to first class. Well worth using a travel agent.\n\nThings work different in Canada and I assume the OP is Canadian as Sunwing is a Canadian company.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]very nice deal, I am dreaming to be upgraded to first class?","Attachments":[],"Id":1880029,"PostDate":1418134620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 03 December 2014 - 06:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Were you able to do this and get perks?<br><br>\nI got 2 free trips and an upgrade to first class. Well worth using a travel agent.<br><br>\nThings work different in Canada and I assume the OP is Canadian as Sunwing is a Canadian company.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>very nice deal, I am dreaming to be upgraded to first class?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401284870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78442,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd660b243786d69433b4da27353f4861","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1880029\" timestamp=\"1418152620\"]\nvery nice deal, I am dreaming to be upgraded to first class?[\/quote]I almost declined it as I have kids but my friend said she&#039;d sit with them :) great friend\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1880032,"PostDate":1418135207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 09 December 2014 - 02:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>very nice deal, I am dreaming to be upgraded to first class?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI almost declined it as I have kids but my friend said she'd sit with them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> great friend<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Format